#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Taj GPU čvor ili GPU ne postoji, ili se nalazi na uređaju kojem nemate pristup."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "Upit za podatke GPU-a nije mogao biti dodan uređaju. Provjerite jesu li šabloni dodatka instalirani."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Uređaj: uređaj čvora je izbrisan, tako da se čvor može samo onemogućiti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Uređaj: odaberite postojeći Cacti uređaj."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Uređaj: ovaj uređaj je već GPU čvor."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "GPU čvor je sačuvan."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "GPU čvor nije mogao biti sačuvan."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "GPU čvor je uklonjen. Njegov Cacti uređaj je ostavljen na mjestu."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "GPU čvor nije uklonjen jer mu pripadaju GPU zapisi. Umjesto toga ga onemogućite; GPU zapisi se nikada ne brišu."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "GPU sada pripada čvoru na kojem je zabilježen, zajedno sa svojom historijom."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU ostaje na svom zabilježenom čvoru."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU će napustiti upit za podatke pri sljedećem ponovnom indeksiranju. Njegovi grafikoni i RRD datoteke ostaju sačuvani."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "Samo odsutan GPU može biti uklonjen iz upita za podatke."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Kreiranje uređaja zahtijeva dozvolu za upravljanje Cacti uređajima."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Opis: unesite do 150 znakova za ispis."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Naziv hosta: unesite naziv hosta ili IP adresu."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Šablon uređaja GPU Node nije instaliran."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Uređaj nije zadržan: vaš nalog nema dozvolu da vidi uređaje koje kreira. Zamolite administratora da ga kreira."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Uređaj nije mogao biti uklonjen nakon odbijanja pristupa. Zamolite administratora da ga ukloni."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Uređaj i njegov GPU čvor su kreirani. Konfigurišite SNMP postavke uređaja na njegovoj stranici."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "Uređaj nije mogao biti kreiran; pogledajte Cacti zapisnik."

